      "writtenOn": "2026-02-10T16:13:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have tested and confirmed that this is not producing extra draws. Note: we are not adding layers here, we append the draw directly to its parent. Regardless, this behavior is effectively removed in the stencil transpose CL.",
