      "lineNbr": 113,
      "author": {
        "id": 3948337
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-06T20:03:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is effectively the \"no chained\" setup I had here:\nhttps://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1153336\n\nThe performance was middling (see sheet \"comparison\", collumn \"No Chain\"), I suspect because it introduces additional Layers:\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cHC_yPNJIvjyYyMfHHNs7D_sDNLkEIAYKd0VEI-u-D4/edit?usp\u003dsharing\n\nI will rebase that patch and try it after more fixes here.",
      "parentUuid": "018b3ed5_07833b4d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 111,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 113,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "d5112d1b7732921920bd084e702feab9e92880f6",
